<title>USA: Hilton Hotels sees other hotel acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Hilton Hotels sees other hotel acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilton Hotels Corp, which last week launched a $6.5 billion hostile takeover of ITT Corp, said Monday it plans to announce other hotel acquisitions soon.</p>
<p>&quot;There are alot of things on our plate. We've got things working on the hotel side,&quot; senior vice president of corporate affairs Marc Grossman told reporters at a Montgomery Securities Hospitality Conference.</p>
<p>Grossman declined to discuss details about the anticipated acquisitions.</p>
</text>
